msgstr "link:https://phoenix.arize.com/[Arize Phoenix] 已被 link:https://www.dynatrace.com/[Dynatrace] 收购。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://www.traceloop.com/[Traceloop] was acquired by https://www.servicenow.com/[ServiceNow]."
msgstr "link:https://www.traceloop.com/[Traceloop] 已被 link:https://www.servicenow.com/[ServiceNow] 收购。"

